IDENTIFICATION DIVISION.
PROGRAM-ID. LOAN-CALC.
*> Loan Amortization Calculator (batch protocol).
*> Input row  (SYSIN):  principal annual_rate_pct term_months
*> Output row (SYSOUT): monthly_payment total_interest total_payable
ENVIRONMENT DIVISION.
DATA DIVISION.
WORKING-STORAGE SECTION.
01 WS-LINE            PIC X(200).
01 WS-TOK-PRINCIPAL   PIC X(40).
01 WS-TOK-RATE        PIC X(40).
01 WS-TOK-TERM        PIC X(40).
01 WS-EOF             PIC 9 VALUE 0.
01 WS-PRINCIPAL       PIC 9(9)V99.
01 WS-ANNUAL-RATE-PCT PIC 9(3)V999.
01 WS-TERM-MONTHS     PIC 9(3).
01 WS-MONTHLY-PAYMENT PIC 9(9)V99.
01 WS-TOTAL-INTEREST  PIC 9(9)V99.
01 WS-TOTAL-PAYABLE   PIC 9(9)V99.
01 WS-OUT-PAYMENT     PIC 9(9).99.
01 WS-OUT-INTEREST    PIC 9(9).99.
01 WS-OUT-TOTAL       PIC 9(9).99.

PROCEDURE DIVISION.
MAIN-PARA.
    PERFORM UNTIL WS-EOF = 1
        MOVE SPACES TO WS-LINE
        ACCEPT WS-LINE
            ON EXCEPTION
                MOVE 1 TO WS-EOF
            NOT ON EXCEPTION
                PERFORM PROCESS-ROW
        END-ACCEPT
    END-PERFORM
    STOP RUN.

PROCESS-ROW.
    MOVE SPACES TO WS-TOK-PRINCIPAL WS-TOK-RATE WS-TOK-TERM
    UNSTRING FUNCTION TRIM(WS-LINE) DELIMITED BY ALL SPACE
        INTO WS-TOK-PRINCIPAL WS-TOK-RATE WS-TOK-TERM
    END-UNSTRING
    IF WS-TOK-TERM = SPACES
        EXIT PARAGRAPH
    END-IF
    COMPUTE WS-PRINCIPAL = FUNCTION NUMVAL(WS-TOK-PRINCIPAL)
    COMPUTE WS-ANNUAL-RATE-PCT = FUNCTION NUMVAL(WS-TOK-RATE)
    COMPUTE WS-TERM-MONTHS = FUNCTION NUMVAL(WS-TOK-TERM)

    IF WS-TERM-MONTHS = 0
        MOVE 0 TO WS-MONTHLY-PAYMENT
    ELSE
        IF WS-ANNUAL-RATE-PCT = 0
            COMPUTE WS-MONTHLY-PAYMENT ROUNDED =
                WS-PRINCIPAL / WS-TERM-MONTHS
        ELSE
            COMPUTE WS-MONTHLY-PAYMENT ROUNDED =
                WS-PRINCIPAL * (WS-ANNUAL-RATE-PCT / 1200)
                / (1 - (1 + WS-ANNUAL-RATE-PCT / 1200)
                       ** (0 - WS-TERM-MONTHS))
        END-IF
    END-IF

    COMPUTE WS-TOTAL-PAYABLE ROUNDED =
        WS-MONTHLY-PAYMENT * WS-TERM-MONTHS
    COMPUTE WS-TOTAL-INTEREST ROUNDED =
        WS-TOTAL-PAYABLE - WS-PRINCIPAL

    MOVE WS-MONTHLY-PAYMENT TO WS-OUT-PAYMENT
    MOVE WS-TOTAL-INTEREST  TO WS-OUT-INTEREST
    MOVE WS-TOTAL-PAYABLE   TO WS-OUT-TOTAL
    DISPLAY WS-OUT-PAYMENT " " WS-OUT-INTEREST " " WS-OUT-TOTAL.
